1
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:17,639
Don't sleep. Don't count. Don't... do anything.

2
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:36,500
[On the mirror: DON'T COUNT]

3
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:43,841
Who are you?

4
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:53,051
If you count... he'll know... that you heard.

5
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:04,070
Ask Rosa. Ask Rosa what happened in 1986.

6
00:01:04,120 --> 00:01:07,633
Rosa... that's my grandmother.

7
00:01:11,500 --> 00:01:15,172
Too late. He's listening.
